      <h1 id="wo-01-implementation-evidence">WO-01 implementation evidence</h1>
<h2 id="summary">Summary</h2>
<ul><li>Authorized scope: WO-01/R01/R10 code and tests only. No production access, deployment, live migration or protected-branch merge.</li><li>Baseline: <code>9fae3248aadecaa53198a5fb9f06576fdcc182cf</code>, branch <code>hudhud_fm</code>; initial tracked tree clean.</li><li>Node gates use installed Node <code>22.23.3</code>; PATH default Node26 is not used for application acceptance.</li><li>C01 contract independently reviewed; deletion-precondition and legacy-conflict clarifications incorporated before fixes.</li><li>R01 and R10 remain <strong>OPEN</strong>. Code and local proof do not establish live-data cleanup.</li></ul>
<h2 id="execution-and-locks">Execution and locks</h2>
<p>I owns the shared contracts, Rules/tests and delete source. BE owns the unique partition/save/helper tests and real editorial emulator test. Runtime E is exclusive to I. All other work orders remain unexecuted. B01 executes C01 only; its WO-03/04 milestones are outside this authorization.</p>
