<p>B05 passed independent read-only review of T09 and T09a. The reviewer independently ran 33 producer tests and 23 standalone-tool tests, all passing with zero skips; reviewed actual integrated Functions206 and email-emulator14 GREEN logs; and confirmed the intended RED assertions. No introduced bypass or regression was found.</p>
<p>T09a evidence: <code>B05-legacy-red.log</code> (12 tests: 2 pass, 10 intended privacy/default-write failures); <code>B05-legacy-green.log</code> (23 passed, zero skips; 11 additional guards are not RED evidence); <code>B05-legacy-provenance.json</code> records source/test hashes and commands. Syntax and whitespace checks passed.</p>
<p>The standalone tool is import-safe, requires an explicit project/root, defaults to dry-run and requires <code>--apply</code> to write. Its main entry point was not invoked. Existing unbounded source reads, batching and creation races are preserved and do not receive production acceptance. It must remain quiesced during separately approved privacy cleanup. Example preparation-only syntax: <code>node tool/migrate-legacy-users.mjs --project=&lt;explicit-project&gt; --root=HudHudDev</code>; live invocation is not authorized here.</p>
