<h3 id="new-mandatory-stop">New mandatory stop</h3>
<p>The mandatory actual admin gate failed in <code>web_admin/test/location-relations.emulator.test.ts:34</code>. Its shared station fixture contains private fields and both new-station request calls omit the explicit private state. The new helper correctly fails closed with <code>ContentError: Reload station metadata before continuing.</code> before the stale-location RPC. The test expects <code>functions/failed-precondition</code>, so its intended stale-location assertion is no longer reached. Its concurrent station-creation branch can also accept this early failure without proving the original race behavior.</p>
<p>No source/test fix was made after this mandatory gate failed. Do not weaken the private-revision guard or change the expected rejection to a client error to make the gate pass. The proposed next change is a narrowly scoped test-compatibility amendment: preserve the public-only location fixture or supply explicitly loaded private revision state to both station requests, and retain the actual server stale-location assertion/concurrency coverage. Before touching that currently WO-03-registered test file, I must record the WO-01/R01 write-set and ownership amendment. The existing 33 shared-file owners remain unchanged until an explicit amendment is recorded.</p>
<p>All 17 previously skipped registered cases ran in the actual command:16 passed and the location case failed; the2 new T05 privacy cases passed. This does not waive B15 integration, full Flutter or physical-device obligations, nor close any other finding. Ordinary test19-skips were not counted as passes. Independent B03 review is being collected read-only; B03 is not accepted or complete, and B06 has not started. R01/R10 remain OPEN. No migration, production access, deployment or protected merge was performed.</p>
<p>Continued source/test modifications: <code>web_admin/components/admin/admin-app.tsx</code>, <code>web_admin/components/admin/user-actions-modal.tsx</code>, <code>web_admin/lib/resource-filters.ts</code>, <code>web_admin/test/resource-filters.test.ts</code>, <code>firestore.rules</code>, <code>firebase_tests/firebase-rules/firestore.rules.test.js</code>; execution report and Boss runtime/rendered artifacts also updated.</p>
