<p>Full 04-T09/B15 remain incomplete, B16 is NOT STARTED and all R01–R13 findings remain OPEN. The original 17 emulator identities, exact-candidate integration, mandatory full Flutter tests, physical-device acceptance and browser acceptance remain obligations. No production data operation, live migration, deployment or protected merge was authorized or executed. This append-only ledger checkpoint changes no source, contract, manifest, runtime or acceptance status beyond the precise conditional review record.</p>
